<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, falls on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling gains on dollar, falls on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell slightly against the sterling pound but gained on the dollar, the Central Bank of Tanzania said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling exchanged at a commercial bank mean rate of 624.6999 compared to Tuesday's 624.7296. Against the pound, it was posted at 1023.5739 from 1022.6855.</p>
<p>Mark Dodd ++255 51 112939</p>
</text>
